Human Patrol Continue Move
    Events
        Time - PatrolTentTimerStay expires
    Conditions
        (All units of PatrolGroup1 are dead) Equal to False
    Actions
        -------- Remove tent --------
        Unit - Remove PatrolGroup1Tent from the game
        -------- Pick all units and set them move with slowed speed --------
        Set VariableSet PatrolMovePoint = (Random point in 06Thornwoods <gen>)
        Unit Group - Order PatrolGroup1 to Patrol To PatrolMovePoint
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_PatrolMovePoint)
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in PatrolGroup1 and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Unit - Set (Picked unit) movement speed to 100.00
                Unit - Remove Wander (Neutral) from (Picked unit)
        -------- Start timer with random value to when the patrol will build tent and stay for random time --------
        Countdown Timer - Start PatrolTentTimerStart as a One-shot timer that will expire in (Random real number between 60.00 and 360.00) seconds
